  - id: historian_wond
    text: Well... Now that you point that out I have to admit you are quite correct.
      My head is concentrated on my studies. So if you would just leave, I would
      be very appreci.... Wait... Are you a sailor?
    choices:
    - label: Yes
      nextNodeID: historian_exci
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Leave
