      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: historian_exci
    text: Well if that isn't a strike of fate. What an odd coincidence at this time
      and place... Anyway. I have an important task for you! GO south of this island.
      A huge battle took place a while ago and I am looking for a brave soul who
      would want to risk their life for historical treasures!
    choices:
    - label: '''Risk my life''?'
      nextNodeID: historian_expl
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: I'll go
      nextNodeID: historian_expl
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: historian_expl
    text: Yes yes! Great! Watch out for currents, many historical figures perished
      in this location. Bring me something of value. Now go!
    choices:
    - label: Wait what do I get?
      nextNodeID: historian_fame
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
